{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01R7c7nLSG6ZRa29XuCWAKmc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. The vllm.yaml override settings don't have any transformers-related overrides, confirming the constraint is purely in the pipeline repository's `collections/rhaiis/cpu-ubi9/constraints.txt`.\n\nNow let me also look at the job metadata to understand the full context.\n\nNow I have all the information I need for the RCA. Let me read the section templates to understand the format.\n\nKey findings:\n1. **Error**: `transformers>=5.6.0` with constraint `transformers<5` - irreconcilable conflict\n2. **Source of requirement**: `vllm 0.24.0+rhaiv.1` - updated in commit `f1275582` on 2026-07-10 (AIPCC-17429)\n3. **Source of constraint**: `collections/rhaiis/cpu-ubi9/constraints.txt` with a comment explaining it was added to prevent compressed-tensors from pulling in transformers 5.x\n4. **Root cause**: When vllm was upgraded from 0.21.0 to 0.24.0 (AIPCC-17429), the constraint wasn't updated to match vllm 0.24.0's new requirement for `transformers>=5.6.0`, even though the constraint's own comment indicates it was originally created specifically for vllm's needs.\n5. **Impact**: Both aarch64 and x86_64 builds fail with identical errors.\n6. **Fix**: The constraint is now stale—it was meant to prevent other packages from pulling in transformers 5.x when vllm couldn't support it, but vllm itself now requires transformers 5.6.0 or higher, so the constraint needs to be removed. A fix commit was already created on 2026-07-18 but hasn't been merged into the current SHA being tested. Now I'm moving on to write out the RCA report using the section templates.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1441,"cache_read_input_tokens":83479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1441,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ea133810-9e1f-4653-a656-18c578a01f91","uuid":"cdbf196a-1ad6-40f9-920a-5c020b7e6e2a","timestamp":"2026-07-20T22:02:06.448Z","request_id":"req_vrtx_011CdE4dVJva4jNsXNWMtxML"}
